  "notes": "{変動|へんどう} refers to fluctuation or change — often unpredictable shifts in values, conditions, or situations.\n\nFORMS:\n{変|へん} (change) + {動|どう} (movement).\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {気候|きこう}{変動|へんどう}: climate change\n- {価格|かかく}{変動|へんどう}: price fluctuation\n- {為替|かわせ}{変動|へんどう}: exchange rate fluctuation\n- {変動|へんどう}{相場|そうば}: floating exchange rate\n- {変動|へんどう}{金利|きんり}: variable interest rate\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {変動|へんどう}する: to fluctuate, to shift\n- {変動|へんどう}が{激|はげ}しい: fluctuations are severe\n- {変動|へんどう}が{大|おお}きい: large fluctuations\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {変動|へんどう}: fluctuation, change (emphasizes instability and movement)\n- {変化|へんか}: change (more general, can be gradual or stable)\n- {変遷|へんせん}: transition, historical change (long-term shifts)",
